            "TBA equations for the Schr\\\"odinger equation with a regular \
singularity", "comments" -> "39 pages, typos corrected", "journal-ref" -> 
            "J.Phys.A 53 (2020) 33, 335201", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1751-8121/ab96ee", "report-no" -> 
