 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the geometry and mechanics (both classical and \
quantum) of potential\\nwells described by squares of Chebyshev polynomials. \
We show that in a small\\nneighbourhood of the locus cut out by them in the \
space of hyperelliptic\\ncurves, these systems exhibit low-orders/low-orders \
resurgence, where\\nperturbative fluctuations about the vacuum determine \
perturbative fluctuations\\nabout non-perturbative saddles.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
