               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2010.08498\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Hasmik Poghosyan Mrs\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Hasmik Poghosyan\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Recursion relation for instanton counting for $SU(2)$ \
${\\\\cal N}=2$ SYM\\n  in NS limit of $\\\\Omega$ background\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"28 pages, 6 figures, some clarifications and citations \
added,\\n  published version\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP05(2021)088\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we investigate different ways of deriving \
the A-cycle period as\\na series in instanton counting parameter $q$ for ${\\\
\\cal N}=2$ SYM with up to\\nfour antifundamental hypermultiplets in NS limit \
of $\\\\Omega$ background. We\\npropose a new method for calculating the \
period and demonstrate its efficiency\\nby explicit calculations. The new way \
of doing instanton counting is more\\nadvantageous compared to known standard \
techniques and allows to reach\\nsubstantially higher order terms with less \
effort. This approach is applied for\\nthe pure case as well as for the case \
with several hypermultiplets.\\n  We also investigate a numerical method for \
deriving the $A$-cycle period\\nvalid for arbitrary values of $q$. Analyzing \
large $q$ asymptotic we get\\nconvincing agreement with an analytic \
expression deduced from a conjecture by\\nAlexei Zamolodchikov in a different \
context.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
