                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th math-ph math.MP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the anisotropic Kondo line defects in products \
of chiral $SU(2)$ WZW\\nmodels. We propose an ODE/IM correspondence for the \
anisotropic Kondo problems\\nby considering the four-dimensional Chern Simons \
theory in the trigonometric\\ncase. We verify the claim both by explicit \
perturbative calculations in the\\nultraviolet and by exact WKB analysis in \
the infrared. In doing so, we derived\\nthe infrared dynamics of a large \
class of anisotropic line defects.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
