                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2112.11434\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Davide Fioravanti\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Davide Fioravanti and Daniele Gregori\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"A new method for exact results on Quasinormal Modes of \
Black Holes\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"6 pages, 3 tables (Latex), minor corrections\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th gr-qc nlin.SI\""}]}, {
               
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We develop a new method for writing simple exact \
equations characterizing\\ngravity solutions among which black holes and in \
particular the quasinormal\\nmodes. More precisely, we derive the full system \
of functional and\\nThermodynamic Bethe Ansatz non linear integral equations \
of quantum\\nintegrability. In particular, we prove that the Quasinormal \
Modes verify\\ndifferent equivalent exact quantization conditions and \
identify them with Bethe\\nroots. We numerically solve the integral equation \
and compare the results with\\nother methods. Eventually, we can definitely \
certify its simplicity, accuracy\\nand effectiveness. Furthermore, this \
method connects different unexpected\\nfields and paves the way for \
innovative ways of investigations in gravity and\\ngauge theories.\\n\""}]}, {
               
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
