            "  We compute the exact retarded Green's functions in thermal \
$CFT$s with\nchemical potential and angular momenta using holography \
respectively. We\nconsider the field equations satisfied by the quasi-normal \
modes in both\ncharged and rotating black holes in $AdS$ spacetime and mapped \
them to the Heun\nequations by appropriate changes of variables. The AGT \
correspondence allows us\nto find the connection formulae among the solutions \
of the Heun equations near\ndifferent singularities by using the crossing \
relations of the five-point\ncorrelators in the Liouville $CFT$. The \
connection formulae associated with the\nboundary conditions imposed on the \
bulk field equations yield the exact thermal\ncorrelators in the boundary \
$CFT$.\n", "versions" -> {{
