               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2301.06999\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Kwinten Fransen\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Kwinten Fransen\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Quasinormal Modes from Penrose Limits\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"27 pages, 9 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"gr-qc\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use Penrose limits to approximate quasinormal modes \
with large real\\nfrequencies. The Penrose limit associates a plane wave to a \
region of spacetime\\nnear a null geodesic. This plane wave can be argued to \
geometrically realize\\nthe geometrical optics approximation. Therefore, when \
applied to the bound null\\norbits around black holes, the Penrose limit can \
be used to study quasinormal\\nmodes. For instance, this Penrose limit point \
of view makes manifest the\\nsymmetry that emerges in the geometrical optics \
approximation of quasinormal\\nmodes in terms of isometries of the resulting \
plane wave spacetime. We apply\\nthe procedure to warped $\\\\rm{AdS}_3$, \
Schwarzschild black holes and Kerr black\\nholes. In the former we show \
explicitly how the symmetry algebra contracts to\\nthat of the limiting plane \
wave while in the latter we find the expected\\nagreement with numerically \
computed quasinormal modes for large (real)\\nfrequencies.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 17 Jan 2023 16:42:25 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
