Francisco\\n  Morales, Giuseppe Sudano\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"On the stability and deformability of top stars\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
