        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[
          DiskBox[{2.6448185917885656`, 5.06395298314241}, 
           0.06364453000660265],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2307.16626\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yasuyuki Hatsuda\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Yasuyuki Hatsuda, Masashi Kimura\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Perturbative quasinormal mode frequencies\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"48 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"RUP-23-13\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"gr-qc hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We often encounter a situation that black hole \
solutions can be regarded as\\ncontinuous deformations of simpler ones, or \
modify general relativity by\\ncontinuous parameters. We develop a general \
framework to compute high-order\\nperturbative corrections to quasinormal \
mode frequencies in such deformed\\nproblems. Our method has many \
applications, and allows to compute numerical\\nvalues of the high-order \
corrections very accurately. For several examples, we\\nperform this \
computation explicitly, and discuss analytic properties of the\\nquasinormal \
mode frequencies for deformation parameters.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 31 Jul 2023 13:04:04 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
