            "  In the realm of lower-dimensional accelerating spacetimes, it \
is\nwell-established that the presence of domain walls, which are \
co-dimension one\ntopological defects, is a necessary condition for their \
construction. We expand\nthe geometric framework by adding a conformally \
coupled scalar field. This\nendeavor leads to the identification of several \
new families of\nthree-dimensional accelerating spacetimes with \
