            "  In this work we study Liouville conformal blocks with \
degenerate primaries\nand one operator in an irregular representation of the \
Virasoro algebra. Using\nan algebraic approach, we derive modified BPZ \
equations satisfied by such\nblocks and subsequently construct corresponding \
integral representations based\non integration over non-compact Lefschetz \
