            "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  To obtain the waveform template of gravitational waves (GWs), \
substantial\ncomputational resources and exceedingly high precision are often \
required. In\nthe previous study [JCAP 11 (2023) 070], we efficiently and \
