               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the retarded Green's function and the \
greybody factor in\\nasymptotically AdS black holes. Using the connection \
coefficients of the Heun\\nequation, expressed in terms of the \
Nekrasov-Shatashvili (NS) free energy of an\\n$SU(2)$ supersymmetric gauge \
theory with four fundamental hypermultiplets, we\\nderive asymptotic \
expansions for both the retarded Green's function and the\\ngreybody factor \
in the small horizon limit. Furthermore, we compute the\\ncorrections to \
these asymptotic expansions resulting from the resummation\\nprocedure of the \
instanton part of the NS function.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
