            "Juli\\'an Barrag\\'an Amado, Shankhadeep Chakrabortty, Arpit \
Maurya", "title" -> 
            "The effect of resummation on retarded Green's function and \
greybody\n  factor in $AdS$ black holes", "comments" -> "37 pages, 5 figures",
             "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th gr-qc", "license" -> 
            "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We investigate the retarded Green's function and the greybody \
factor in\nasymptotically AdS black holes. Using the connection coefficients \
of the Heun\nequation, expressed in terms of the Nekrasov-Shatashvili (NS) \
free energy of an\n$SU(2)$ supersymmetric gauge theory with four fundamental \
hypermultiplets, we\nderive asymptotic expansions for both the retarded \
Green's function and the\ngreybody factor in the small horizon limit. \
Furthermore, we compute the\ncorrections to these asymptotic expansions \
resulting from the resummation\nprocedure of the instanton part of the NS \
function.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 11 Sep 2024 16:01:24 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2024-09-12", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{
