               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We conjecture a new ordinary differential equation \
exactly isospectral to the\\nradial component of the homogeneous Teukolsky \
equation. We find this novel\\nrelation by a hidden symmetry implied from a \
four-dimensional $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$\\nsupersymmetric quantum chromodynamics. \
Our proposal is powerful both in\\nanalytical and in numerical studies. As an \
application, we derive high-order\\nperturbative series of quasinormal mode \
frequencies in the slowly rotating\\nlimit. We also test our result \
numerically by comparing it with a known\\ntechnique.\\n\""}]}, {
