            "Tatsuya Hosoi", "title" -> 
            "On Formal Series Solutions To 4th-order Quadratic Homogeneous\n  \
Differential Equations And Their Convergence", "comments" -> 
            "9 pages, 0 figure", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "math.CA", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  It is known that all $\\tau$ functions of the Painlev\\'{e} \
equations satisfy\nthe fourth-order quadratic differential equation. Among \
them, for the III, V,\nand VI equations, it is possible to express the formal \
series solutions\nexplicitly by using combinatorics. In this paper, we show \
the convergence of\nthe formal series, including the solutions of more \
general equations. And by\nthe absolute convergence of $\\tau $ series, the \
convergence of the conformal\nblock function ($c=1$) also follows since it is \
a partial sum of the $\\tau $\nseries. We also characterized the form of a \
homogeneous quadratic equation with\na series solution similar to the tau \
functions of the Painlev\\'{e} equations.\nThe Painlev\\'{e} equations are \
classified into six types, and it is known that\nthey can be obtained by \
sequentially degenerating from type VI to type I.\n", 
