Maenaut\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The universal Teukolsky equations and black hole \
perturbations in\\n  higher-derivative gravity\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"50 pages, 5 figures. v3: version published in PRD\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.108.024040\""}]}, {
