Alexander\\n  Zhiboedov\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", "\"A thermal product formula\""}]}, {
               
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"50 pages + appendices, 20 figures, typos corrected and \
citations\\n  added\""}]}, {
