                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10 pages + appendices, 2 figures. Added N=4 SYM, MIS, \
BDNK, kinetic\\n  theory to the hydrohedron plots. Some technical details \
moved to appendices\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
