            "  AGT conjecture reveals a connection between 4D \
$\\mathcal{N}=2$ gauge theory\nand 2D conformal field theory. Though some \
special instances have been proven,\nothers remain elusive and the attempts \
on its full proof never stop. When the\n$\\Omega$ background parameters \
satisfy $-\\epsilon_1/\\epsilon_2\\equiv \\beta =1$,\nthe story simplifies a \
bit. A proof of the correspondence in the case of\n$A_{1}$ gauge group was \
given in 2010 by Mironov et al., while the $A_{n}$\nextension is verified by \
