Russo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"The black hole behind the cut\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"59 pages, 1 figure; v2: 60 pages, minor \
improvements\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
