               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider a deformation of a family of hyperelliptic \
refined spectral\\ncurves and investigate how deformation effects appear in \
the hyperelliptic\\nrefined topological recursion as well as the \
$\\\\mathscr{Q}$-top recursion. We\\nthen show a coincidence between a \
deformation condition and a quantisation\\ncondition in terms of the \
$\\\\mathscr{Q}$-top recursion on a degenerate elliptic\\ncurve. We also \
discuss a relation to the corresponding Nekrasov-Shatashivili\\neffective \
twisted superpotential.\\n\""}]}, {
