2024,\\n  Issue 1, January 2024, 013A02\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1093/ptep/ptad154\""}]}, {
               
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"TIT/HEP-695\""}]}, {
                
