               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Signatures of Ultralight Bosons in Compact Binary \
Inspiral and Outspiral\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"17 pages, 10 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D 108 (2023) 12, 123017\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.108.123017\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"gr-qc astro-ph.CO hep-ph\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Ultralight bosons are well-motivated particles from \
various physical and\\ncosmological theories, and can be spontaneously \
produced during the\\nsuperradiant process, forming a dense hydrogen-like \
cloud around the spinning\\nblack hole. After the growth saturates, the cloud \
slowly depletes its mass\\nthrough gravitational-wave emission. In this work \
we study the orbit dynamics\\nof a binary system containing such a \
gravitational atom saturated in various\\nspin-0,1,2 superradiant states, \
taking into account both the effects of\\ndynamical friction and the cloud \
mass depletion. We estimate the significance\\nof mass depletion, finding \
that although dynamical friction could dominate the\\ninspiral phase, it \
typically does not affect the outspiral phase driven by the\\nmass depletion. \
Focusing on the large orbit radius, we investigate the\\ncondition to observe \
the outspiral, and the detectability of the cloud via\\npulsar-timing signal \
in the case of black hole-pulsar binary.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
