                 "\"v2: version accepted in PRD. Contains a new plot for the \
(330) modes\\n  and we added a new comment on the accuracy of our results. We \
make it clear\\n  that they are accurate enough to allow for precision tests \
of\\n  higher-derivative corrections in future experiments\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
