, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We investigate the scattering of a massless scalar \
field by a charged\\nnon-rotating black hole in the presence of gravity's \
rainbow. Using the\\nconnection coefficients of the confluent Heun equation \
expressed in terms of\\nthe semi-classical confluent conformal blocks and the \
instanton part of the\\nNekrasov-Shatashvili (NS) free energy, we obtain an \
asymptotic expansion for\\nthe low-energy absorption cross section.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
