Najafizade\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Heun-type solutions for the Dirac particle on the curved \
background of\\n  Minkowski space-times\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
