          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2309.14672", "submitter" -> "Amitabh Virmani", "authors" -> 
            "Anand Balivada, Pius Ranjan Padhi, Amitabh Virmani", "title" -> 
            "Tidal Forces in Kerr-AdS and Grey Galaxies", "comments" -> 
            "24 pages, 2 figures; v2: 26 pages, clarifications added, CQG \
version", "journal-ref" -> "Class. Quantum Grav. 41 125008 (2024)", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1361-6382/ad494b", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "gr-qc hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  In a recent paper [arXiv:2305.08922], it has been proposed \
that the endpoint\nof the Kerr-AdS superradiant instability is a Grey Galaxy. \
The conjectured\nsolutions are supposed to be made up of a black hole with \
critical angular\nvelocity in the centre of AdS, surrounded by a large flat \
disk of thermal bulk\ngas that revolves around the black hole. In the \
analysis of the proposed\nsolutions so far, gravitational effects due to the \
black hole on the thermal\ngas have been neglected. A way to estimate these \
effects is via computing tidal\nforces. With this motivation, we study tidal \
forces on objects moving in the\nKerr-AdS spacetime. To do so, we construct a \
parallel-transported orthonormal\nframe along an arbitrary timelike or null \
geodesic. We then specialise to the\nclass of fast rotating geodesics lying \
in the equatorial plane, and estimate\ntidal forces on the gas in the Grey \
Galaxies, modelling it as a collection of\nparticles moving on timelike \
geodesics. We show that the tidal forces are small\n(and remain small even in \
the large mass limit), thereby providing additional\nsupport to the idea that \
the gas is weakly interacting with the black hole.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 26 Sep 2023 04:59:05 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 29 May 2024 04:33:45 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2024-05-30", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Balivada", "Anand", ""}, {
              "Padhi", "Pius Ranjan", ""}, {"Virmani", "Amitabh", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
