               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2311.09831\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Jianfei Xu\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Jianfei Xu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Warped Conformal Symmetries of the Accelerating Kerr \
Black Hole\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"20 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 03 (2024) 050\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP03(2024)050\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th gr-qc\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recent studies on the holographic descriptions of Kerr \
black holes indicate\\nthat the conformal or the warped conformal symmetries \
are responsible for the\\nKerr black hole physics at both background and \
perturbation levels. In the\\npresent paper, we extend the validity of these \
studies to the case of\\naccelerating Kerr black hole. By invoking a set of \
non-trivial diffeomorphisms\\nnear the horizon bifurcation surface of the \
accelerating Kerr black hole, the\\nDirac brackets among charges of the \
diffeomorphisms form the symmetry algebra\\nof a warped CFT which consists of \
one Virasoro and one Kac-Moody algebra with\\ncentral extensions. This \
provides the evidence for warped CFTs being possible\\nholographic dual to \
accelerating Kerr black holes. The thermal entropy formula\\nof the warped \
CFT fixed by modular parameters and vacuum charges reproduces the\\nentropy \
of the rotating black hole with acceleration.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
