         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2311.09831", "submitter" -> "Jianfei Xu", "authors" -> 
            "Jianfei Xu", "title" -> 
            "Warped Conformal Symmetries of the Accelerating Kerr Black Hole",
             "comments" -> "20 pages", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 03 (2024) 050", 
            "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP03(2024)050", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th gr-qc", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  Recent studies on the holographic descriptions of Kerr black \
holes indicate\nthat the conformal or the warped conformal symmetries are \
responsible for the\nKerr black hole physics at both background and \
perturbation levels. In the\npresent paper, we extend the validity of these \
studies to the case of\naccelerating Kerr black hole. By invoking a set of \
non-trivial diffeomorphisms\nnear the horizon bifurcation surface of the \
accelerating Kerr black hole, the\nDirac brackets among charges of the \
diffeomorphisms form the symmetry algebra\nof a warped CFT which consists of \
one Virasoro and one Kac-Moody algebra with\ncentral extensions. This \
provides the evidence for warped CFTs being possible\nholographic dual to \
accelerating Kerr black holes. The thermal entropy formula\nof the warped CFT \
fixed by modular parameters and vacuum charges reproduces the\nentropy of the \
rotating black hole with acceleration.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 16 Nov 2023 11:57:06 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 7 Feb 2024 05:15:41 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Sat, 9 Mar 2024 04:37:24 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v4", "created" -> 
               "Sat, 18 May 2024 06:29:51 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2024-05-21", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Xu", "Jianfei", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
