         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2312.00624", "submitter" -> "Claudia Rella", "authors" -> 
            "Marcos Mari\\~no and Claudia Rella", "title" -> 
            "On the structure of wave functions in complex Chern-Simons \
theory", "comments" -> "42 pages, 3 figures", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            Null, "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th math-ph math.GT math.MP", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the structure of wave functions in complex \
Chern-Simons theory on\nthe complement of a hyperbolic knot, emphasizing the \
similarities with the\ntopological string/spectral theory correspondence. We \
first conjecture a hidden\nintegrality structure in the holomorphic blocks \
and show that this structure\nguarantees the cancellation of potential \
singularities in the full\nnon-perturbative wave function at rational values \
of the coupling constant. We\nthen develop various techniques to determine \
the wave function at such rational\npoints. Finally, we illustrate our \
conjectures and obtain explicit results in\nthe examples of the figure-eight \
and the three-twist knots. In the case of the\nfigure-eight knot, we also \
perform a direct evaluation of the state integral in\nthe rational case and \
observe that the resulting wave function has the features\nof the ground \
state for a quantum mirror curve.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 1 Dec 2023 14:42:12 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2023-12-05", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Mari\[NTilde]o", "Marcos", ""}, {
              "Rella", "Claudia", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
