            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2312.05457\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Chen Lan\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Chen Lan, Meng-Hu Li, Yan-Gang Miao\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phase diagrams of quasinormal frequencies for \
Schwarzschild, Kerr, and\\n  Taub-NUT black holes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Final version appearing in the PRD. 36 pages, 11 \
figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys. Rev. D 110 (2024) 044045\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.110.044045\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"gr-qc hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The Newman-Janis algorithm, which involves \
complex-coordinate\\ntransformations, establishes connections between static \
and spherically\\nsymmetric black holes and rotating and/or axially symmetric \
ones, such as\\nbetween Schwarzschild black holes and Kerr black holes, and \
between\\nSchwarzschild black holes and Taub-NUT black holes. However, \
the\\ntransformations in the two samples are based on different physical \
mechanisms.\\nThe former connection arises from the exponentiation of spin \
operators, while\\nthe latter from a duality operation. In this paper, we \
mainly investigate how\\nthe connections manifest in the dynamics of black \
holes. Specifically, we focus\\non studying the correlations of quasinormal \
frequencies among Schwarzschild,\\nKerr, and Taub-NUT black holes. This \
analysis allows us to explore the physics\\nof complex-coordinate \
transformations in the spectrum of quasinormal\\nfrequencies.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
