                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We address the problem of describing the thermodynamics \
and holography of\\nthree-dimensional accelerating black holes. By embedding \
the solutions in the\\nChern-Simons formalism, we identify two distinct \
masses, each with its\\nassociated first law of thermodynamics. We also show \
that a boundary entropy\\nshould be included (or excluded) in the black hole \
entropy.\\n\""}]}, {
