gravitational\n  wave observables at ${\\cal O}(G^2)$", "comments" -> 
            "Matches published version; 49 pages, 1 figure, revisions of Sec. \
2.3,\n  Sec. 4.1 and Sec. 5 with broader literature review, minor revision of\
\n  notation and typos corrected", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
