               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Ryo Hamachika, Tomoki Nakanishi, Takahiro Nishinaka and \
Shou Tanigawa\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Liouville Irregular States of Half-Integer Ranks\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"25 pages; 3rd version, minor changes made\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"NITEP 199\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We conjecture a set of differential equations that \
characterizes the\\nLiouville irregular states of half-integer ranks, which \
extends the generalized\\nAGT correspondence to all the \
$(A_1,A_\\\\text{even})$ and $(A_1,D_\\\\text{odd})$\\ntypes Argyres-Douglas \
theories. For lower half-integer ranks, our conjecture is\\nverified by \
deriving it as a suitable limit of a similar set of differential\\nequations \
for integer ranks. This limit is interpreted as the 2D counterpart of\\na 4D \
RG-flow from $(A_1,D_{2n})$ to $(A_1,D_{2n-1})$. For rank $3/2$, we \
solve\\nthe conjectured differential equations and find a power series \
expression for\\nthe irregular state $|I^{(3/2)}\\\\rangle$. For rank $5/2$, \
our conjecture is\\nconsistent with the differential equations recently \
discovered by H. Poghosyan\\nand R. Poghossian.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
