                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"v3: 36 pages, 4 figures, references updated, derivation \
of orbital\\n  angular impulse expression in the KMOC Formalism added \
(Appendix B), matched\\n  with the published version\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 05(2024) 148\""}]}, {
                
