               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Can space-time symmetries such as Lorentz, dilatation, \
or conformal symmetry\\nbe recovered at infinite temperature? To address this \
question, we study\\ncorrelation functions of generalized free conformal \
field theories (a.k.a free\\nholographic theories in thermal AdS space-time) \
at infinite temperature. We\\nshow that they are broken at the leading order \
in bosonic correlation\\nfunctions, but a non-trivial scaling symmetry may \
emerge.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
