 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the gravitational anomaly vertex \
$\\\\langle TTJ_5\\\\rangle$\\n(graviton - graviton - axial current) under \
conditions of finite density and\\ntemperature. Through a direct analysis of \
perturbative contributions, we\\ndemonstrate that neither finite temperature \
nor finite fermion density affects\\nthe gravitational chiral anomaly. These \
results find application in several\\ncontexts, from topological materials to \
the early universe plasma. They affect\\nthe decay of any axion or axion-like \
particle into gravitational waves, in very\\ndense and hot \
environments.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
