                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The connection formulae provide a systematic way to \
compute physical\\nquantities, such as the quasinormal modes, Green \
functions, in blackhole\\nperturbation theories. In this work, we test \
whether it is possible to\\nconsistently take the collision limit, which \
bring two or more regular\\nsingularities into an irregular one, of the \
connection formulae, and we provide\\nsome supportive evidence for \
it.\\n\""}]}, {
