            "  We derive the radial action of a spinning probe particle in \
Kerr spacetime\nfrom the worldline formalism in the first-order form, \
focusing on linear in\nspin effects. We then develop a novel covariant Dirac \
bracket formalism to\ncompute the impulse and the spin kick directly from the \
