 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work, we present a comprehensive study of \
holographic stress tensor\\ncorrelators on general Riemann surfaces, \
extending beyond the previously\\nwell-studied torus cases to explore higher \
genus conformal field theories\\n(CFTs) within the framework of the Anti-de \
Sitter/conformal field theory\\n(AdS/CFT) correspondence. We develop a \
methodological approach to compute\\nholographic stress tensor correlators, \
employing the Schottky uniformization\\ntechnique to address the handlebody \
solutions for higher genus Riemann\\nsurfaces. Through rigorous calculations, \
we derive four-point stress tensor\\ncorrelators, alongside recurrence \
relations for higher-point correlators,\\nwithin the \
$\\\\mathrm{AdS}_3/\\\\mathrm{CFT}_2$ context. Additionally, our \
research\\ndelves into the holography of cutoff $\\\\mathrm{AdS}_3$ spaces, \
offering novel\\ninsights into the lower-point correlators of the \
$T\\\\bar{T}$-deformed theories\\non higher genus Riemann surfaces up to the \
first deformation order.\\n\""}]}, {
