               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study certain higher point thermal correlators of \
heavy and light scalar\\nprimaries in a holographic CFT. Assuming simple \
self-interactions and couplings\\nof the scalars in the bulk theory, we show \
that the thermal correlators contain\\na signature of the proper time to \
singularity from the horizon. The key idea is\\nto use WKB approximations for \
the propagators and evaluate the bulk integrals\\nusing saddle point \
method.\\n\""}]}, {
