               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We develop the thermal shadow formalism to study the \
conformal blocks\\ndecomposition in $D$-dimensional conformal field theory on\
\\n$\\\\mathbb{S}_{\\\\beta}^{1} \\\\times \\\\mathbb{S}^{D-1}$, where the \
temperature is $T =\\n\\\\beta^{-1}$. It is demonstrated that both the \
1-point thermal ($T\\\\neq 0$)\\nconformal blocks and the 4-point plane \
($T=0$) conformal blocks are defined by\\nthe same 4-point conformal \
integral. It is shown that up to power prefactors\\nthe 1-point thermal \
conformal block is given by the fourth Appell function.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
