               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Zel'dovich and Polnarev, in their seminal paper [1] \
extending previous work\\non the Memory Effect, suggested that a \
gravitational wave generated by flyby\\nwould merely displace the particles. \
We confirm their prediction numerically by\\nfine-tuning the wave profile \
proposed by Gibbons and Hawking [2], and then\\nanalytically for its \
approximation by a P\\\\\\\"oschl-Teller potential. Higher-order\\nderivative \
profiles proposed for gravitational collapse, etc [2] are \
shortly\\ndiscussed.\\n\""}]}, {
