Chris\\n  Kavanagh, Justin Vines\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Post-Newtonian observables for aligned-spin binaries to \
sixth order in\\n  spin from gravitational self-force and Compton \
amplitudes\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"35 pages, 3 ancillary files\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
