          DiskBox[{3.3943757054175885`, 0.1478617697540825}, 
           0.08283829248930569],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2409.12898\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Samim Akhtar\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Samim Akhtar\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On the classical limit of the (sub)$^{n}$-leading soft \
graviton theorems\\n  in $D = 4$ without deflection\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"34 pages, 1 figure\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Tree-level gravitational amplitudes satisfy an infinite \
hierarchy of soft\\nfactorization theorems. The existence of these theorems \
has been recently\\nlinked with the existence of an infinite tower of \
asymptotic symmetries. In\\nthis paper, we analyze the relevance of the soft \
graviton theorems beyond\\nsub-leading order in the context of classical \
gravitational scattering in four\\ndimensions. More in detail, we show that \
the infinite impact parameter limit of\\nthe late-time gravitational field \
emitted during a classical scattering can be\\nderived using these \
factorization theorems. The classical field obtained in\\nthis (infinite \
impact parameter) regime has an expansion in the frequency of\\nthe detector \
where the modes scale as $\\\\omega^{n}\\\\log{\\\\omega}$ with a \
vanishing\\nmemory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 19 Sep 2024 16:39:54 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2024-09-20\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Akhtar\"", ",", "\"Samim\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
